+# Task 2 Brief: 更新 catga-axum 移除 Raft HTTP 代码
+
+## Goal
+从 catga-axum 中删除 HttpRaftTransport 和 RaftHttpCluster，保留 HTTP 服务器相关代码。
+
+## Files to Delete
+- `crates/catga-axum/src/cluster.rs` (删除)
+- `crates/catga-axum/src/client.rs` (部分删除 HttpRaftTransport 相关)
+
+## Files to Modify
+- `crates/catga-axum/src/lib.rs` (移除 Raft 相关导出)
+- `crates/catga-axum/src/prelude.rs` (移除 Raft 相关导出)
+- `crates/catga-axum/Cargo.toml` (移除 catga-cluster 依赖)
+
+## Types to REMOVE (delete these exports)
+- `HttpRaftTransport`
+- `RaftHttpCluster`
+- `RaftHttpClusterBuilder`
+- `RaftClusterConfig` (来自 catga-cluster)
+
+## Types to KEEP (these are needed by other crates)
